\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" height=\"20\" width=\"20\">$8$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$\\,\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{5\\,\\phantom{|}0\\,\\phantom{|}4}$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td align=\"left\" width=\"250\">\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr height=\"20\">\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\nNotice that $5$ (the number of hundreds in $504$) is less than the divisor $8.$ Therefore, we should consider both the hundreds and tens:\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"150\">\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$6$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" height=\"20\" width=\"20\">$8$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$\\,\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{5\\,\\phantom{|}0\\,\\phantom{|}4}$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$4$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$8$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$↓$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$2$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$4$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td align=\"left\" width=\"250\">\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Divide: $50÷8=6\\,\\text{R}\\,2$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Write over tens: $6$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"25\">\n<td>Multiply: $8\\times 6=48$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Subtract: $50-48=2$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"25\">\n<td>Bring down: $4$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\nNext, we consider the ones:\n\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"150\">\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$6$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$3$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#EBF5FB\" height=\"20\" width=\"20\">$8$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$\\,\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{5\\,\\phantom{|}0\\,\\phantom{|}4}$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$4$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$8$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$2$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$4$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$-\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$2$</td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$4$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\" height=\"20\" width=\"15\">$\\boxed{\\text{0}}$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td align=\"left\" width=\"250\">\n<table align=\"left\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Divide: $24÷8=3$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Write over ones: $3$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"25\">\n<td>Multiply: $8\\times 3=24$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr height=\"20\">\n<td>Subtract: $24-24=0$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\nWe get the remainder $0$, so the division is done.\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n504÷8=63.\n$$" 13194139534844 17592186045417 true] [17592186440826 1058 #edb/ref 17592186440827 13194139534844 17592186045417 true] [17592186440826 1062 #uuid "0216fd09-2f2b-54b3-bef2-5a231a977b91" 13194139534844 17592186045417 true] [17592186440826 1063 #edb/ref 17592186440397 13194139534844 17592186045417 true] [17592186440827 1058 #edb/ref 17592186440829 13194139534844 17592186045417 true] [17592186440827 1062 #uuid "1a94c276-640b-545e-a04c-e330a5a242bc" 13194139534844 17592186045417 true] [17592186440827 1063 #edb/ref 17592186440393 13194139534844 17592186045417 true] [17592186440828 1062 #uuid "232eb213-9c5a-5ee6-97f2-100765f33e43" 13194139534844 17592186045417 true] [17592186440828 1063 #edb/ref 17592186440823 13194139534844 17592186045417 true] [17592186440829 1058 #edb/ref 17592186440832 13194139534844 17592186045417 true] [17592186440829 1062 #uuid "624c9ceb-59e5-5d35-98c1-a18ab719dec0" 13194139534844 17592186045417 true] [17592186440829 1063 #edb/ref 17592186440395 13194139534844 17592186045417 true] [17592186440830 1058 #edb/ref 17592186440831 13194139534844 17592186045417 true] [17592186440830 1062 #uuid "72323577-5a50-54c6-a65d-bc25ba76f581" 13194139534844 17592186045417 true] [17592186440830 1063 #edb/ref 17592186440392 13194139534844 17592186045417 true] [17592186440831 1058 #edb/ref 17592186440833 13194139534844 17592186045417 true] [17592186440831 1062 #uuid "a8cab5b1-8ff1-5abd-bce3-91aa26f135b2" 13194139534844 17592186045417 true] [17592186440831 1063 #edb